# www → the bare domain, once and permanently.
#
# The store consoles, Google's OAuth consent screen and the privacy
# policy all point at https://rafiqpro.com/... with no www. One
# canonical host keeps those URLs matching what the browser shows, and
# the pages' own <link rel="canonical"> already names the bare domain.
#
# BOTH hostnames must be added to the Pages project first
# (Pages → the project → Custom domains → add rafiqpro.com AND
# www.rafiqpro.com). A redirect cannot run for a hostname the project
# does not serve.
#
# :splat carries the rest of the path, so /privacy/ and /ar/privacy/
# survive the hop. 301 because this is permanent and should be cached.
https://www.rafiqpro.com/* https://rafiqpro.com/:splat 301
